translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_7709c803:

    # e "Hey, Sebas. You've got something for me to send?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯。你有东西要让我寄送吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_09ac30ee:

    # s "Yes! well. I didn't expect you to be the courier today."
    s "是的！呃，我没想到今天会是你来送货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_53565546:

    # s "But anyway, I have this small coffer here that I need you to deliver to Lothar."
    s "不过话说回来，我这里有个小箱子，需要你替我送给洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_0253ab16:

    # e "Uh... what's it for?"
    e "呃……这是做什么用的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8a58b584:

    # s "N-nothing! I mean, uhm... it's Ole's ointment since I kicked him in the nuts the other day."
    s "没、没什么！我是说，呃……这是奥利的药膏，前几天我踢了他的蛋蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_333f8626:

    # s "N-nothing! I mean, uhm... he dropped this in the shop the day we went to check on that moss fellow."
    s "没、没什么！我是说，呃……那天我们去查看那个苔藓家伙时，他把这东西落在店里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_30722395:

    # "You furrow your brows, suspiciously taking the coffer from his hands."
    "你皱起眉头，满腹狐疑地从他手里接过小箱子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b74f209f:

    # e "It doesn't feel too heavy."
    e "感觉不是很重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9881c40b:

    # s "Yeah it's for protection. Just don't open it yourself before giving it to Lothar, it's for his eyes only-"
    s "对，这是用来防护的。你交给洛萨尔之前可别自己打开，只能让他本人看——"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8653c8f4:

    # e "O-okay."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_4aad5d4b:

    # s "Yes! A customer bought something a while back. I'm sending it to him."
    s "是的！之前有位客人买了件东西。我正要把它寄给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_6ac175ed:

    # e "Oh? What is it?"
    e "哦？是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_2726e968:

    # s "Just some supplies he needed. Nothing too special."
    s "只是一些他需要的补给品。没什么特别的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d5ab04d0:

    # e "Alright, I'm on my way."
    e "好，我这就去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f7872bc1:

    # s "Roomie! You're taking my package today? Well, here's the gold I owed Cane."
    s "室友！今天是你帮我送包裹吗？呃，这是我欠凯恩的金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_e61cf92b:

    # s "It's a long story, though I can't really recall what I did with it. I was really drunk, you know."
    s "说来话长，不过我实在想不起来把它弄哪儿去了。当时我醉得厉害，你懂的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_0ac8f0eb:

    # e "Yeah I get it, Seb."
    e "嗯，我明白，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_7b0abc42:

    # s "Anyway, just make sure it gets to the right place, alright? I don't want him knocking on the door here."
    s "总之，记得把它送到该去的地方，行吗？我可不想让他找上门来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d198ce8c:

    # s "Yes, yes. I've picked some flowers from the last little trip. Rahim is gonna love these."
    s "对，对。我上次出去时采了些花。雷希姆肯定会喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_ee57013c:

    # e "Oh? What are they for?"
    e "哦？这些花是做什么用的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_38f7fdfe:

    # s "His special kind of fabric, you know how it is. That old bull likes turning these flowers into something nice and smooth."
    s "做他那种特殊布料的，你懂的。那头老公牛喜欢把这些花做成漂亮又光滑的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_158087fa:

    # e "Alright then, I'll get these to him in a moment."
    e "好吧，那我马上把这些给他送去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_0c8646a3:

    # s "Oh, yes. Take these, take these to Gwyd, roomie."
    s "哦，对了。把这些、把这些送给格威德，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8db524b8:

    # e "W-what are those, stones?"
    e "这、这些是什么，石头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_620c27eb:

    # s "Stones, Rocks. I picked them up on the road the other day, looking odd aren't they, I'm thinking they're no ordinary rocks."
    s "石头，岩石。我前几天在路上捡的，看起来很奇怪，对吧？我觉得它们可不是普通的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_490c7f30:

    # e "Well then, what are they?"
    e "那它们到底是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9ddb97bd:

    # s "I don't know, that's why I need Gwyd to appraise them for me, it's gotta be gold this time."
    s "我不知道，所以才需要让格威德替我鉴定。这次肯定是金子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b0f11576:

    # e "A-alright, Seb. I'll let him look at the rocks."
    e "好、好吧，塞巴斯。我会让他看看这些石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_6e547d2c:

    # e "Hey, Ole. You've got something for me to send?"
    e "嘿，奥利。你有东西要让我送吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b15f7f2a:

    # o "Yeah. Well, I just need you to take this Ointment, the boys out there got themselves hurt again."
    o "嗯。是这样，我只要你把这瓶药膏带过去，外面的那些小子又把自己弄伤了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_a2b25101:

    # o "Make sure to give it to them quickly, [e]. We're counting on you."
    o "记得尽快交给他们，[e]。我们可指望你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_307e51af:

    # e "Oh, no problem!"
    e "哦，没问题！"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_842cc3c7:

    # o "Rahim's flowers. He specifically asked for those the last time we met."
    o "雷希姆的花。他上次见面时特意要了这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_3768a982:

    # e "Oh? And the gold too?"
    e "哦？金币也要送吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_ae20fa71:

    # o "Yes, it's the gold lining. It's important for the fabric, as he said so."
    o "对，是金线。正如他所说，这对布料很重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_158087fa_1:

    # e "Alright then, I'll get these to him in a moment."
    e "好吧，那我马上把这些给他送去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_4933d7f2:

    # o "It's for the goat chief. Make sure you get this to him quickly kiddo."
    o "这是给山羊族长的。记得尽快把这个送到他手里，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9979e8a3:

    # o "I've heard Furkan's been really out of it since that incident in the temple, this might help him with the pain."
    o "我听说自从神殿那次事故后，弗坎一直浑浑噩噩的，这东西或许能帮他缓解疼痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_664ce2bc:

    # e "Okay, I'll make sure all of this gets to him safely."
    e "好，我会确保把这些东西安全送到他手里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b9bb8004:

    # e "Cane, you need to send something?"
    e "凯恩，你有什么东西要寄吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_fbbf42a4:

    # c "Aye, I baked a few too many breads today, take those to Ole would'ya?"
    c "哎，我今天面包烤多了几个，帮我把这些带给奥利，行不？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f5335a55:

    # c "Heard he likes them wheaty grubs. Ol' lizard's rounding out his belly proper."
    c "听说他喜欢那些麦虫。那条老蜥蜴正好拿来填饱肚子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_7da99214:

    # e "Alright, I'll be on my way."
    e "好，我这就上路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_fb717a3f:

    # e "Lothar, do you need something to send?"
    e "洛萨尔，你有什么东西要寄吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d5c1bdaa:

    # l "Yes, disciple. I came back from another successful adventure, and there are some spare loots for the old bull."
    l "是的，弟子。我刚从又一次成功的冒险中回来，还有些多出来的战利品要给那头老公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_7cc288aa:

    # l "Make sure that old bull gets his cloths, disciple. Maybe one day, one day I'll take you to my next adventure."
    l "务必把那头老公牛的衣物送到，弟子。也许有一天，有一天我会带你去参加我的下一场冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8025984c:

    # e "Hey, Rahim. You've got something for me to send?"
    e "嘿，雷希姆。你有东西要我寄吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8ca3a5d9:

    # r "Yes, I need you to take the order to the Lusterfolk. It's right over there."
    r "有，我需要你把这份订单送到卢斯特菲尔德人那里。就在那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_79bc9ac6:

    # e "What's it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_79ba2b53:

    # "The bull look up from his table, his eyes narrowing."
    "那头公牛从桌边抬起头，双眼眯了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_66ffbed4:

    # r "A garment, body covering."
    r "一件衣物，遮身用的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_cc501f87:

    # "Rahim turns back as his hand pushes you towards the door."
    "雷希姆转过身来，同时伸手把你往门口推。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d67250f4:

    # r "Here they are. Just some spare parts I had lying around."
    r "给，东西在这儿。只是我随手放着的几件备用零件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f4514aa7:

    # r "The dog over at the farm moaned about the scarecrow again."
    r "农场那边的狗又在抱怨稻草人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_17401425:

    # e "Oh? The scarecrow? What happened to it?"
    e "哦？稻草人？它怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_3f77baee:

    # r "Landshark's bites... or someone ticked him off most probably."
    r "大概是被陆鲨咬了……或者更可能是有人惹恼了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_3864f5eb:

    # e "A-alright. I am on my way."
    e "好、好的。我这就上路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_4ba6ecc9:

    # e "Hey, Haimo, do the folks need anything sent?"
    e "嘿，海莫，大家有什么东西要寄吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_fc09b840:

    # hm "Yes, one, actually. I need you to take this letter to Rahim."
    hm "有一件，确切地说。我需要你把这封信带给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_761f2882:

    # hm "Looks to be some sort of inquiry about the city's matter."
    hm "看起来像是在询问城里的事务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9e9a1bb1:

    # e "Oh? Why did he send it to Rahim?"
    e "哦？他为什么要把信寄给雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f9a3e61a:

    # hm "We're used to Rahim being the go-to guy for these matters, not sure why."
    hm "我们一向把这类事交给雷希姆处理，至于原因，我也不清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_42c37222:

    # hm "As you probably know, we don't have a mayor around here, so he's probably the closest we have since the incident with the goats."
    hm "你大概也知道，这附近没有市长，所以自从那次山羊事件后，他大概就是我们最接近市长的人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b15fbc6f:

    # e "Why not just make him the Mayor, then?"
    e "那为什么不干脆让他当镇长呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_2f25c9c2:

    # hm "I don't know, I've heard stories from the elders that we don't talk about the last mayor anymore, they said after he died, all the candidates just... mysteriously died, in different ways."
    hm "我也不知道。我听长老们讲过一些故事，他们说，我们已经不再提起上一任镇长了。他死后，所有候选人都……以各种方式神秘地死去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_b480cadc:

    # hm "So, we just never had a leader since then, until the goats attacked."
    hm "从那以后，我们就一直没有领袖，直到山羊族发动袭击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_42acb86d:

    # e "Alright, I'll take it to Rahim then."
    e "好吧，那我就把它送给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f08be2d5:

    # hm "Don't take too long, Rahim's waiting."
    hm "别耽搁太久，雷希姆还在等着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_a6f9c0b1:

    # hm "Yes. I have a bouquet here, for Lothar they said."
    hm "对。他们说这里有一束花，是送给洛萨尔的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_f770f6af:

    # hm "Looks like an admirer of his. There's been dozens of these every week."
    hm "看起来像是他的仰慕者送的。他每周都会收到几十束这样的花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_333a619f:

    # hm "I think he tosses it aside after getting them, it's a shame, look at all those special flowers."
    hm "我觉得他收到后就把花扔到一边了，真可惜。你看看那些多特别的花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_6c670984:

    # e "What about the flowers?"
    e "这些花怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9c665f67:

    # hm "Oh, you see, this, this blue one. They called it the drowned sage. It was said that when Lusterfield flooded, it was one of the few plants that stood tall."
    hm "哦，你看，就是这朵蓝色的。他们称它为“溺水贤者”。据说卢斯特菲尔德被洪水淹没时，它是少数依然挺立的植物之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_27911aed:

    # hm "It was the first thing the settlers saw when the waters receded, and it was glistening blue, they said it was the last blessing of the forest god."
    hm "洪水退去后，定居者们第一眼看到的就是它。听说它闪耀着蓝光，是森林之神最后的祝福。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_a487c2fc:

    # e "This flower... it has quite the story."
    e "这朵花……还真有一段故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_a788d267:

    # hm "Yeah, it does. It's only seen in Lusterfield, and there weren't many left today."
    hm "确实如此。它只生长在卢斯特菲尔德，而且今天剩下的已经不多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_045c2f56:

    # hm "Well, if I keep talking I'm afraid the flowers are going to wilt. Get them delivered instead, won't you?"
    hm "好了，要是我继续说下去，我怕这些花都要枯萎了。还是把它们送去吧，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_2b35a2af:

    # e "Alright, I'll take it to Lothar then."
    e "好吧，那我就把它送给洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d83e4cb8:

    # hm "Good. And be gentle with the flowers."
    hm "很好。记得轻拿轻放，别弄坏这些花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_479d27c3:

    # hm "Just a few coffers and letters here and there I need you to take to the Goats."
    hm "这里有几只箱子和一些信，需要你顺便送给山羊族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_161fdffb:

    # hm "The Goats are still pretty touchy with us, so just drop them in the community box and they'll have goats take care of it."
    hm "山羊族现在对我们还是很敏感，所以把东西放进公共箱里就行，他们会让山羊族的人处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_187ab850:

    # e "Alright, I'll get them to the goats now."
    e "好吧，我现在就把它们送到山羊族那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_e10bdd5a:

    # hm "On your way then."
    hm "那就上路吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9391e0e8:

    # hm "It's a weapon, commissioned from the goats for one of their huntsmen. Take those to the general and he'll know what to do."
    hm "这是一件武器，是山羊族为他们的一名猎手定制的。把这些送给将军，他知道该怎么处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_828e2b70:

    # hm "Be careful and try not to prick your innards on the way there."
    hm "小心点，路上可别让它刺穿你的内脏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_5c50c14c:

    # "Haimo chuckles to himself as he hands you the weapon."
    "海莫把武器递给你，独自轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_013c543a:

    # hm "Oh, have you met the general? Kari? I saw him around asking about the courier board a few times."
    hm "哦，你见过将军吗？卡里？我见过他几次在附近打听信使公告板的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_356e527d:

    # e "I did. A few times."
    e "是的。几次吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_1b8ab08d:

    # hm "He's got that mask... I happened to read about it earlier, it was quite interesting where the tradition came from."
    hm "他戴着那副面具……我之前碰巧读到过相关内容，面具传统的起源还挺有意思的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_51639a56:

    # e "What about the mask?"
    e "那面具是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d95fa5a0:

    # hm "They said a long long time ago, one night, every goat saw the drifter in their dream."
    hm "据说很久很久以前，有一天晚上，每只山羊都在梦里见到了那个漂泊者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_99bf3feb:

    # e "W-wait, who's the drifter?"
    e "等、等等，漂泊者是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_a20d5cea:

    # hm "A mysterious deer with a cane on his hand, his face is obscured I think."
    hm "一只神秘的鹿，手里拿着手杖，我想他的脸被遮住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_0e2d1843:

    # hm "Anyway, they said the drifter was someone connected to the gods, so in order to communicate with the drifter, they had a deer dressing up like him to act as their shaman."
    hm "总之，据说那个漂泊者与诸神有所关联。为了与他沟通，他们让一只鹿打扮成他的样子，充当他们的萨满。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_4fd39292:

    # hm "A mask, a staff, some antlers, with a hint of artistic liberty of course, that was how it all started."
    hm "一副面具、一根法杖、几只鹿角，当然还带着一点艺术加工——一切就是这样开始的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_9ab91369:

    # hm "They never saw the drifter again, and they had not have a summoning ritual for a while now, but the tradition stuck around til now."
    hm "他们后来再也没见过那个漂泊者，也已经有一阵子没举行召唤仪式了，但这个传统一直保留到了现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_d623b12d:

    # e "That's... odd. I've heard something from Kari but not to that extent."
    e "这……真奇怪。我听卡里提起过一些，但没说得这么详细。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_049b9a46:

    # hm "It's a strange story isn't it? I'm sure the general himself would be happy to tell you about it if you ask him."
    hm "这是个奇怪的故事，对吧？我敢肯定，只要你问将军本人，他一定很乐意告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_de137d2f:

    # e "Um, I'm not sure he's ever happy at anything, but thanks."
    e "嗯，我不确定他什么时候会对什么事感到高兴，不过还是谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_1223a4a0:

    # e "Alright then, I'll give it to Kari."
    e "那好，我把它交给卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_5fbdedfb:

    # hm "Good, take care!"
    hm "好，保重！"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_17993868:

    # e "Hey, Amble. Do you have something for me?"
    e "嘿，安布。你有什么东西要给我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_ba579894:

    # a "Here, here. I need you to take those to the goats, for their bridge building project."
    a "给，给。我需要你把这些送给山羊们，用于他们的桥梁建造工程。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_cf2561cf:

    # e "Oh? Those are a lot of heavy stuff!"
    e "哦？这些东西真沉！"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_dceb6214:

    # a "Yes, after the vote I kept thinking about the bridge, I've gathered the materials, but it's difficult to build it all by myself."
    a "是啊，投票之后我就一直在想着那座桥。我已经收集好了材料，但要靠我一个人把它建起来可不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_23521fcc:

    # a "The goats can make use of it, I've talked to their chief about it, he sounded rather keen."
    a "山羊们正好用得上这些。我已经和他们的酋长谈过了，他听起来相当感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_af983b87:

    # e "Alright, if it isn't the chief himself! I'll take those to their tribe then."
    e "哎呀，这不是酋长本人吗！那我就把这些送到你们部落去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_4397421c:

    # a "Thanks, [e]!"
    a "谢谢你，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_c064e2cb:

    # a "Yes, I've collected a bit of meat scraps today for Cane."
    a "是的，我今天收集了一些肉渣，给凯恩的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_5df3038b:

    # a "Here it is, the stew's going to taste amazing."
    a "给你，熬出来的炖菜肯定香得不得了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_c9b33323:

    # "You take the scraps from Amble."
    "你从安布那里接过肉渣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_e35598b9:

    # e "Alright, I'll take it to Cane then."
    e "好，那我就把它送给凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_8ce8e647:

    # a "Thanks! Puny courier."
    a "谢谢！弱不禁风的小信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_2f450032:

    # e "Jog, I've heard you needed to send something?"
    e "乔格，我听说你有东西要寄？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_c5e1233c:

    # j "Oh, yeah. Just some meat and stuff. Here you go."
    j "哦，对。就一些肉之类的。给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_5a1801f2:

    # j "I'd have gone myself but I'm not entirely in the mood for it."
    j "我本来可以自己去，但现在实在没那个心情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_eb2eb736:

    # "Jog yawns as he slouches on the hay bales. Hands behind the back of his ears, he lazily tosses the ingredients to you."
    "乔格懒洋洋地瘫坐在干草捆上，打了个哈欠。他双手搭在耳后，懒散地把那些食材朝你一扔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_22a393b0:

    # e "Alright, I'll hand it to Cane then."
    e "好吧，那我就把它交给坎恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_002c93dd:

    # e "Officer, is there anything you need to send over the river?"
    e "长官，你有没有什么东西要送到河对岸？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Pickup_Dialogues_70a834b4:

    # gof "Yes, this one,"
    gof "有，这件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6a1e6501:

    # e "Rahim, I've got a delivery for you."
    e "雷希姆，我有一件东西要交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b5c2ed87:

    # r "Which one is it?"
    r "是哪一件？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6bb4ea77:

    # e "It's a letter, addressed to you."
    e "是一封信，收信人是你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_dc6e0db1:

    # r "Ugh, alright. Just leave it on the pile over here."
    r "呃，好吧。就把它放到这边这堆上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_44b5802c:

    # "He points towards the corner of the room, where a stack of letters and packages is piled high."
    "他指向房间角落，那里堆着高高一摞信件和包裹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_a6ad8026:

    # e "Uhm, do you even read them?"
    e "呃，你真的会看这些信吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_0cca2cbe:

    # r "I'll read it when I have time. If it's really urgent they'll come find me."
    r "有时间我就会看。要是真急，他们会来找我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_9076dd17:

    # r "Alright, give it to me."
    r "好吧，给我吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_5dd87379:

    # "You hand over the letter to Rahim, but he looks a bit peeved."
    "你把信递给雷希姆，但他看起来有些不高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6a455046:

    # e "Is everything alright?"
    e "没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_4f89a5ce:

    # r "Yeah, just another headache to go through, thanks for the letter though."
    r "嗯，只是又有个头疼的问题要处理。不过还是谢谢你送来这封信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_dfec3e6d:

    # e "It's from Lothar, he said you might need some spare loots from him."
    e "这是洛萨尔寄来的，他说你可能需要他那里多出来的一些战利品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6c104919:

    # r "Ugh, fine. Just leave it on the table. Thanks."
    r "呃，好吧。就把它放桌上。谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_cca5a4bb:

    # "Rahim returns to his workbench, grumbling as you put down the clothes."
    "雷希姆回到他的工作台前，你放下衣服时，他嘴里还在嘟囔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c8c5b9a3:

    # e "It's the flowers and gold, seems like Sebas and Ole collected them for you."
    e "是花和金币，看起来是塞巴斯和奥利替你收集的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_8354c9f0:

    # r "Finally, those took long enough. I'll get to work on the outfit right away."
    r "总算来了，这些东西可真让我等够久了。我马上就开始做这身衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e85a3188:

    # "Rahim takes the flowers and gold from you, his eyes lighting up."
    "雷希姆接过你递来的鲜花和金币，双眼顿时亮了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d4581632:

    # r "These are perfect, just what I needed. Thanks, [e]."
    r "这些正合适，就是我需要的。谢谢你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d71f99eb:

    # e "Ole, I've got a delivery for you."
    e "奥利，我有件东西要交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e157aaa5:

    # o "Oh? Kiddo, you didn't-"
    o "哦？小家伙，你没——"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_77e7129c:

    # "Ole's eyes light up as soon as he sees the few pieces of bread in your hands."
    "奥利一看到你手里的几片面包，双眼就亮了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e2377db2:

    # e "It's a few pieces of bread, Cane said you liked them."
    e "这是几片面包，凯恩说你喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_23019cc7:

    # o "Yes! I can smell that tavern hearth's aroma from miles away. Thank you, [e]."
    o "是啊！隔着老远我都能闻到那家酒馆炉火的香气。谢谢你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_8c2359bb:

    # e "Hey, Cane. I've got a delivery for you. It's from Sebas."
    e "嘿，凯恩。我有件东西要交给你。是塞巴斯托我带来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_95061fb0:

    # c "Oh, the gold he owed me for?"
    c "哦，是他欠我的那笔金币？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_efeec2a5:

    # e "Yeah, here it is."
    e "对，给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_40aec4a1:

    # c "Lemme see, lemme see..."
    c "让我看看，让我看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_061c589e:

    # c "Yeah, lad, that's the one. Thanks, and tell'm to maybe stop playing bets in my place, will ya?"
    c "对，小子，就是这个。谢了，告诉他以后能不能别在我这儿下注了，行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1a0155a3:

    # e "Cane, I've got a delivery for you. It's some meat, and a few pieces of flower."
    e "凯恩，我有件东西要交给你。是些肉，还有几朵花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_31d85938:

    # c "Ooh! Great! Put'em into the stew here would'cha?"
    c "哦！太好了！把它们放进这锅炖汤里，行不？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_0d5dd54b:

    # "You turn to the pot and add the ingredients one by one. Cane stirs the pot with a ladle, the aroma of the meat instantly fills the air."
    "你转身来到锅边，把食材一一放进去。凯恩用勺子搅拌着锅里的炖汤，肉香顿时弥漫在空气中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_36b46d2d:

    # c "Thanks lad. Got a good feeling about this one, come by in a moment and I'll get ya a taste."
    c "谢了，小子。我觉得这锅汤肯定不错。过一会儿再来，我让你尝尝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_5a22ce97:

    # e "Haha, looking forward to it."
    e "哈哈，我很期待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_cb2afed7:

    # e "Hey, Lothar. I've got a delivery for you."
    e "嘿，洛萨尔。我有件东西要交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c9361662:

    # e "It's from Ole."
    e "是奥利送来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c3a01726:

    # l "Nice... where's it?"
    l "不错……东西在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_2eb92b9b:

    # e "Right here."
    e "就在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_abdeb84f:

    # "You hand over the ointment to Lothar."
    "你把药膏递给洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_3f9d015e:

    # l "Just what I needed. I tell you, [e]. This is the only reason why I stayed cordial with that lizard."
    l "正是我需要的。我跟你说，[e]，要不是为了这个，我才不会一直对那只蜥蜴客客气气的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_47fd3906:

    # e "Glad to hear it."
    e "听你这么说我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b042d8d6:

    # l "You can go now, disciple."
    l "你现在可以走了，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d682010a:

    # l "First, call me Lothar. Second, a gift? From who?"
    l "首先，叫我洛萨尔。其次，礼物？谁送的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c755d043:

    # "You hand over the bouquet to Lothar."
    "你把花束递给洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_3db6ff3b:

    # e "It's from an admirer of yours. It said you saved their life recently."
    e "是你的仰慕者送的。对方说你最近救过对方一命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_5549c816:

    # "You notice a faint frown on Lothar's face as he stares at you."
    "你注意到洛萨尔盯着你时，眉头微微皱起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6f12f758:

    # l "I see..."
    l "我明白了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1686b279:

    # l "Huh... I wonder who it could be, I've saved so many of them lately."
    l "嗯……我想知道会是谁。我最近救过那么多人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b72aeb22:

    # l "Maybe I should start keeping a list. Did I save more this week?"
    l "也许我该开始列个名单。这周我救的人更多吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e0800a61:

    # l "You may go now, disciple. Also, maybe you can learn a thing or two from this... admirer."
    l "你现在可以走了，弟子。另外，也许你能从这位……仰慕者身上学到一两点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e1a8d6a8:

    # l "Oh? What's this? I don't remember getting something like this."
    l "哦？这是什么？我不记得收到过这种东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_fd664a84:

    # l "Who sent it?"
    l "谁送的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_f7feea81:

    # e "Uh, Sebas."
    e "呃，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_937a56c7:

    # l "That lion, what's he got for me? An apology for the humiliation I suffered that day?"
    l "那头狮子给我准备了什么？是为我那天遭受的羞辱道歉吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1884bc9a:

    # e "Well, let me first check what's inside."
    e "嗯，让我先看看里面是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_7094abb6:

    # l "W-what are you doing, disciple."
    l "你、你在做什么，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b42cbf83:

    # "You yank the coffer from Lothar hands, opening it yourself."
    "你从洛萨尔手中一把夺过箱子，亲自将它打开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b9c776b2:

    # "As soon as you open it, a ball of gust bursts out, it doesn't smell too appetizing."
    "你一打开箱子，一团气流便喷涌而出，闻起来可不怎么令人食欲大开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_5283717a:

    # e "Owww-"
    e "呜——"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e4384382:

    # "You stumble back, rubbing your snout, Lothar quickly catches you."
    "你踉跄着后退，揉着鼻子，洛萨尔迅速接住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_9fe73a00:

    # l "The fuck was that?"
    l "那他妈是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_055c1746:

    # e "I have no idea... Sebas told me to give it to you personally."
    e "我不知道……塞巴斯让我亲自把它交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c1d2c5cb:

    # l "Fucking lion, I won't be forgetting this. Let him know."
    l "该死的狮子，我不会忘了这事的。让他知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_9de170f8:

    # "As soon as Lothar flips open the lid, a ball of gust bursts out, it doesn't smell too appetizing."
    "洛萨尔一把掀开盖子，一团气流便喷涌而出，闻起来可不怎么令人食欲大开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_297a7a05:

    # l "What the f- Ugh-"
    l "搞什么鬼——呕——"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_b7609ca5:

    # "You can't help but laugh at the sight, as Lothar's expression shifts from surprise to disgust."
    "看到这一幕，你忍不住笑了起来，洛萨尔的表情也从惊讶变成了厌恶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_f2735622:

    # l "Disciple, are you trying to kill me?"
    l "弟子，你是想杀了我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_3f31ad72:

    # e "No, no. I- I don't know anything about this."
    e "不，不。我——我什么都不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_3ad8ae3e:

    # l "You better not be lying to me, I can smell your lies, [e]."
    l "你最好没骗我，我闻得出你的谎言，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d1b1e314:

    # "You gulp."
    "你咽了口唾沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_79880372:

    # l "And that lion... I won't be forgetting this. Let him know."
    l "还有那头狮子……这事我不会忘。替我转告他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_bfb4eda1:

    # "Lothar looks away as his expression softens."
    "洛萨尔移开视线，神情也缓和下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_abc19afd:

    # l "Now go. I need to clean after this."
    l "现在走吧。我得收拾残局。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_21306c91:

    # e "Hey, Jog. I've got a delivery for you. It's from Ole."
    e "乔格，我有你的货。是奥利托我带来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_f8a869c5:

    # j "Oh, good. Just throw the thing over here. My body's aching like hell."
    j "哦，太好了。把那东西扔过来就行。我浑身疼得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_7cf8829d:

    # "You toss the ointment over to Jog. He quickly opens it and smears it over his fur."
    "你把药膏扔给乔格。他迅速打开药膏，抹在自己的毛上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_55d83181:

    # j "Ahh, that's much better. Thanks, [e]."
    j "啊，这下好多了。谢谢你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d6f7f050:

    # e "No problem, Jog. Just take it easy, alright?"
    e "没事，乔格。你悠着点，行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_73d1c82f:

    # "He gives you a light chuckle."
    "他轻笑了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_0ef8249b:

    # e "Kari, I've got a delivery for you. It's from Lusterfield."
    e "卡里，我有你的货。是从卢斯特菲尔德送来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6d94b1e4:

    # k "What's this...?"
    k "这是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_40de8b71:

    # "Kari grabs the weapon from your hand, he inspects it closely, tapping it against his palm a few times."
    "卡里从你手中拿过武器，仔细端详起来，还在掌心上轻轻敲了几下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_cc8ac909:

    # k "Uh huh, it's... adequate. For what it's worth, my men will like the quality quite a bit."
    k "嗯……还算过得去。话虽如此，我的手下会相当喜欢它的品质。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_6edacfd5:

    # k "Give my gratitude to your weaponsmith."
    k "替我向你的武器匠人致谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_ef42ce1f:

    # e "Will do!"
    e "没问题！"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_65d8c920:

    # e "Furkan, here's some supplies I've got from Ole."
    e "弗坎，这是我从奥利那里拿来的补给。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_4e903a37:

    # f "Thank you, courier. It will help with the pain."
    f "谢谢你，信使。这能帮我缓解疼痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_902bf159:

    # e "A-are you alright, Furkan? Does it still hurt?"
    e "你——你还好吗，弗坎？还疼吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e8485cfb:

    # f "Yes, it has been better since that day, after all. But the pain still somewhat lingers."
    f "是的，毕竟从那天起已经好些了。不过疼痛还是没有完全消退。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_ed451fe7:

    # e "Fair enough, take care Furkan."
    e "这样啊，那你保重，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_55cec0ee:

    # "The goat chief nods."
    "山羊族酋长点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_c36592d8:

    # e "Gwyddyon, Sebas said he wants you to appraise these stones."
    e "格威迪恩，塞巴斯说他想让你鉴定这些石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_300cf072:

    # g "Again? How many useless rocks is he gonna send my way..."
    g "又来？他到底还要把多少没用的石头送到我这儿来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_d1845554:

    # "Gwyddyon points to the shelf full of rocks behind him, all in different shapes and sizes."
    "格威迪恩指了指身后那架堆满石头的架子，上面的石头形状大小各异。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_2983f771:

    # g "Put them over these, please."
    g "请把它们放到这些上面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1c31b7cd:

    # e "Um, are you gonna appraise them?"
    e "呃，你要鉴定它们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_09f78223:

    # g "Yes, my appraisal is... no don't let him know. I'll keep the stones safe. Just tell him to bring different rocks next time."
    g "嗯，我鉴定的结果是……不，别让他知道。我会把这些石头保管好。只要告诉他下次带些不同的石头来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_e7d7c4b0:

    # e "A-alright. Will do."
    e "好、好的。没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_14f35f6a:

    # e "Rahim sent here some spare parts for the scarecrows."
    e "雷希姆给这里送来了一些稻草人的备用零件。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_f8db920a:

    # ar "Oh, good. That damn thing keeps getting his insides eaten by those landsharks."
    ar "哦，太好了。那该死的东西老是被那些地鲨掏空肚子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_5053b589:

    # e "Are they alright?"
    e "它们没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_1d154eb7:

    # ar "Don't you worry, little pup. They don't die, or they don't get to."
    ar "别担心，小崽子。它们不会死，或者说，它们根本没法死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_98b195bc:

    # e "Haimo, here's a coffer for you."
    e "海莫，这里有个箱子给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_985d288d:

    # hm "You mean, for the Lusterfolk, huh? Right, I'll make sure it gets to them. Thanks."
    hm "你的意思是，给卢斯特菲尔德人的，对吧？行，我会确保它送到他们手里。谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_26b79c47:

    # e "Officer, here's some stuff from Lusterfield."
    e "长官，这是卢斯特菲尔德送来的一些东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_ee6061eb:

    # gof "What is it? Take it closer..."
    gof "这是什么？拿近点……"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_7aaeb5e4:

    # "You wait as the officer squints, leaning forward more and more."
    "你等着，军官眯起眼睛，身体一点点向前倾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_fecea9b9:

    # gof "Oh yes, it's for the goats, right."
    gof "哦，对，是给山羊们的，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Courier_Delivery_Dialogues_60022afb:

    # gof "Well, thanks, boy. I'll take it from here."
    gof "好吧，谢谢你，小子。接下来交给我吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_fe9738ee:

    # "You walk up towards the courier board, where a hefty goat stands, leaning against the tree lazily."
    "你走向邮递板，那里站着一只壮硕的山羊，正懒洋洋地倚着树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_fe7780ec:

    # hm "Just put what you need to send right over there. Make sure the name of the recipient is legible."
    hm "把你要寄的东西放到那边就行。确保收件人的名字清晰可辨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_8f2f372c:

    # "The goat watches you with a bored expression. His words almost slurred together as he speaks."
    "山羊百无聊赖地看着你，说话时，话音几乎都含混成了一片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_ef007094:

    # e "Hey... Haimo? You're the Postmaster, right? Ole asked me to talk to you."
    e "嘿……海莫？你就是邮务长，对吧？奥利让我来和你谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_3773a1a1:

    # hm "Hmmm, what does he want?"
    hm "嗯……他想干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_694ba43a:

    # "You show him the courier badge on your bag. He raises an eyebrow, intrigued."
    "你给他看了包上的快递员徽章。他饶有兴致地挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_a920de04:

    # hm "Oh, I see. You're the new courier, huh? Nice to meet you, young man. The courier board is over there."
    hm "哦，我明白了。你就是新来的邮差，对吧？很高兴认识你，年轻人。邮递板就在那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_9ad8131a:

    # e "My name is [e]. And nice to meet you, Haimo."
    e "我叫[e]。很高兴认识你，海莫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_e3ac7072:

    # "The postmaster's eyes brightens as he leans in closer to inspect you."
    "邮政局长俯身凑近打量你，眼睛顿时亮了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_fb3ba6b7:

    # hm "Doesn't look too bad. The other couriers would have you go through more trainings, but clearly Ole has faith on you."
    hm "看起来不算太糟。其他信使会让你接受更多训练，但显然奥利对你很有信心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_9cd3ad15:

    # hm "Just make sure to follow the procedures, alright?"
    hm "只要确保按规章办事，明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_025a6ea7:

    # "You nod in agreement."
    "你点头表示同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_928a8803:

    # hm "Good. Here's a few things you need to know before I let you go on your first delivery."
    hm "很好。在我让你去送第一趟货之前，有几件事你得知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_84aa1175:

    # hm "First, you can't steal anything from the packages. If you do, you're out of the job."
    hm "首先，你不能偷包裹里的任何东西。要是敢这么做，你就别想干这份工作了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_658591f6:

    # hm "Second, always double-check the recipient's name and address before leaving."
    hm "第二，出发前一定要再三核对收件人的姓名和地址。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_680fb853:

    # hm "And last but not least, don't lose your badge. It's your lifeline out there."
    hm "最后同样重要的是，别弄丢你的徽章。它可是你在外面的保命符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_e26918b2:

    # e "Oh, I see. Is there anything else I should know?"
    e "哦，我明白了。还有什么我需要知道的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_a970f207:

    # hm "Well, don't miss a delivery, you'll be penalized."
    hm "嗯，别漏送任何一件货，否则你会受罚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_1334e6ec:

    # e "By who?"
    e "谁来罚？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_0e329c0d:

    # hm "By me, of course. Some deliveries expire after a certain time, so make sure you get them done on time." nointeract
    hm "当然是我。有些货物过了一定时间就会失效，所以一定要按时送达。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_877c801f:

    # e "What if I have questions later?"
    e "那我之后有问题怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_5a42a644:

    # hm "You can always come back to me. Ask me anything, if you'd like."
    hm "你随时可以回来找我。想问什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_0e6929a3:

    # e "What if I need help with a delivery?"
    e "如果我需要有人帮忙送货呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_9c980b78:

    # hm "Just ask around. There are plenty of folks around here who can lend a hand."
    hm "问问周围的人就行。这里有的是愿意搭把手的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_a144760a:

    # e "Got it."
    e "明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_78a0d2e6:

    # hm "Good. Now get out there and make those deliveries."
    hm "很好。现在出去，把那些货都送了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_20942e53:

    # e "Good day, Haimo."
    e "海莫，祝你今天愉快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Dialogue_4de36bd6:

    # hm "Good day, [e]."
    hm "你好，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_88ba9f8a:

    # hm "Got any packages to send today?" nointeract
    hm "今天有要寄的包裹吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_225ab54f:

    # e "So, Haimo... you're a goat, huh?"
    e "所以，海莫……你是山羊，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_cfdef987:

    # hm "That's right. What's the matter with that?"
    hm "没错。那又怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_57da6042:

    # e "But why are you a goat?"
    e "可你为什么是山羊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_5aa537cd:

    # "The postmaster squints."
    "邮政局长眯起了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_a067bcc9:

    # hm "We need to work on the wording here, [e]. It's coming off very outlandish."
    hm "这措辞得改改，[e]。听起来太离谱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_267e5c7b:

    # hm "Look, courier. Lusterfield is all I've ever known, I don't have anything to do with the goats out there."
    hm "听着，邮差。卢斯特菲尔德是我一直以来唯一熟悉的地方，我跟外面的那些山羊可没什么关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_accb25b8:

    # e "So, you were raised here?"
    e "所以，你是在这里长大的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_86d52ebb:

    # hm "Yes, I was never a part of the tribe in the west. My ancestors were one of the few goats that settled back here."
    hm "是的，我从未属于西边的部族。我的祖先是少数迁回这里定居的山羊之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_1816b87a:

    # hm "Well, rather than digging into my heritage, did you know that us goats are excellent climbers? We could scale through the mountains like it's nothing."
    hm "不过，与其深挖我的身世，你知道我们山羊都很擅长攀爬吗？我们穿过山脉就跟走平地一样轻松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_4bcac639:

    # hm "The strength comes from my paws, you see, the rough pads here are tough and rubbery, it's like suction cups on each of my finger gripping into a hard surface."
    hm "你看，力量就来自我的脚掌。这些粗糙的肉垫坚韧又有弹性，就像吸盘一样，每根脚趾都能牢牢抓住坚硬的表面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_ff06becf:

    # "Haimo presents you with his paws, he clutches the surface of the tree tightly, his feet firmly balances on the rough bark of the tree."
    "海默把他的脚掌展示给你看。他紧紧抓住树的表面，双脚稳稳踩在粗糙的树皮上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_a9b2f429:

    # hm "It works on any surface, honestly. I wouldn't let go even if I wanted to."
    hm "说真的，它在任何表面都管用。就算我想放手，也未必放得开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_c89003c4:

    # e "I'd love to try it out one day..."
    e "我真想哪天也试试看……"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_6b819866:

    # hm "Maybe you can give it a shot sometime."
    hm "以后你也许可以试一试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_1d15593d:

    # "The goat shrugs."
    "山羊耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_735d6610:

    # e "What's the deal with couriers?"
    e "邮差到底是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_59a4a582:

    # hm "Oh? Didn't know you were the inquisitive type."
    hm "哦？我还不知道你是这么爱刨根问底的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_a640a54f:

    # hm "Couriers have been around for ages, as you probably know, the terrain and weather can be quite challenging, and wild creatures can pose a threat."
    hm "邮差这个行当由来已久，你应该也知道，地形和天气都可能相当棘手，野外的生物也会带来威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_93865c1e:

    # hm "That's where the couriers come in, braving the elements and dangers to ensure that important items reach their destinations safely and on time."
    hm "邮差就是在这时派上用场的：他们不畏恶劣环境与重重危险，确保重要物品安全、准时送达目的地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_d0c5b12c:

    # e "Sounds like a tough job."
    e "听起来是份辛苦活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_60972cc8:

    # hm "Did you know, couriers used to be messengers for the royalties? It's not until the giant rift that formed in the eastern mountains that we started having our own couriers."
    hm "你知道吗，邮差过去可是王室的信使？直到东部山脉形成那道巨大的裂谷后，我们才开始有自己的邮差。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_a7564361:

    # hm "Now, Lusterfield has our very own couriers running on errands across the village, ensuring everything runs smoothly."
    hm "如今，卢斯特菲尔德也有自己的邮差在村里四处跑腿，确保一切顺利运转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_5adea4fc:

    # hm "For this side of the mountains, we used to mainly run between the village and the goat tribe across the river. They had their own wagons for transport, but we were way faster for urgent deliveries."
    hm "在山脉这一侧，我们过去主要往返于村子和河对岸的山羊部落之间。他们有自己的运输马车，但遇到紧急投递时，我们可比马车快多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_19fae5c5_1:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_f4d68c94:

    # hm "Did I bore you? Well, let's change the subject before I start getting into the details that's worth 10 hours of listening."
    hm "我是不是把你说烦了？那还是换个话题吧，免得我开始讲起那些一说就是十小时的细节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_2a5339db:

    # e "Postmaster, what's the courier job like around here?"
    e "邮政局长，这附近的邮差工作是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_326c4afe:

    # hm "You deliver messages and packages between the villagers around here, usually. It's a vital role, the village is rather big so we have to be quick on our feet to get things where they need to go."
    hm "你们通常负责在附近的村民之间传递信件和包裹。这份工作至关重要，村子相当大，所以我们得腿脚麻利，才能把东西送到该去的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_77f730db:

    # hm "Everyone has their own rank, the higher your rank, you'll get more deliveries with better rewards."
    hm "每个人都有自己的等级，等级越高，你接到的投递就越多，奖励也越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_5d52baf5:

    # hm "When you meet new people around here, you can get new requests from them as well."
    hm "在这附近遇到新的人时，你也能从他们那里接到新的委托。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_7aaa3d18:

    # e "Alright, do I need to do anything special to rank up?"
    e "好吧。那提升等级需要做什么特别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_2c828fca:

    # hm "Just keep doing your deliveries and building your reputation. The more reliable you are, the more opportunities you'll get."
    hm "你只要继续完成投递，提升自己的声望就行。你越可靠，得到的机会就越多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_2590e56a:

    # hm "Also, I forgot to mention, if you see Lusterfolk in your deliveries, just come ask me. We'll handle the rest."
    hm "对了，我忘了说，如果你在投递途中遇到露斯特族，就来找我。剩下的交给我们处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_559d6f53:

    # e "So, Haimo, how did you become the postmaster?"
    e "那么，海莫，你是怎么成为邮务主管的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_f031fb1d:

    # hm "Ah, that's... well. I started as a regular courier, just like you. I became a courier and worked my way up."
    hm "啊，这个嘛……嗯。我一开始和你一样，只是个普通的信使。后来我成了正式信使，一步步升了上来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_0f4ea3ea:

    # hm "But the others, they can be quite challenging, we used to have our fair share of disagreements and compete for deliveries to earn our keep."
    hm "不过，其他人可都不太好对付。我们过去经常发生争执，还会为了争夺投递、养活自己而相互竞争。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_36c5a7ac:

    # hm "As you know, we didn't have a proper mayor around here so no one was here to handle their disputes, so one day some of them came up to me and asked if I could help handle the courier board."
    hm "你也知道，这附近一直没有个像样的镇长，没人来处理他们之间的纠纷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_fd9e3ae1:

    # hm "I agreed, and so they called me the postmaster. I guess part of the reason why they picked me was because I was never involved in any of their squabbles."
    hm "我答应了，于是他们就叫我邮务主管。我猜，他们选中我的部分原因，是因为我从没参与过他们之间的那些争吵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_4a0f0021:

    # e "Sounds like you're the right one for the job then."
    e "听起来，你确实是这份工作的合适人选。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_0bb5779a:

    # hm "Well, I try my best. But I can't say if the job is not quite boring. Most of the time I'm just standing here, waiting for deliveries to come in."
    hm "嗯，我会尽力而为。不过，这工作也确实挺无聊的。大多数时候，我就站在这里，等着投递送来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_a2bd95ca:

    # e "I know, you do look kinda bored all the time."
    e "我知道，你看起来一直都有点无聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_2f0fc4e4:

    # hm "I... I do? It's just my resting face I assure you. W-well, I guess maybe, it's been a while since someone held a conversation with me for so long."
    hm "我……我有吗？我保证，那只是我平时的表情。呃——嗯，我想，可能确实已经很久没人陪我聊这么久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_bd789a14:

    # "The postmaster blushes as his hand scratches the back of his head, looking away awkwardly."
    "邮务主管红着脸，抬手挠了挠后脑勺，尴尬地移开视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_e158d451:

    # hm "Those other couriers just check the board and go, without a word. I appreciate you taking the time to chat with me, sometimes, maybe, I guess."
    hm "其他信使都是看看公告板就走，一句话也不说。有时……也许吧，我很感谢你愿意抽时间陪我聊天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_6fcb7b75:

    # e "That's enough for now, thanks, Haimo."
    e "今天先聊到这里吧，谢谢你，海莫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_1b21925e:

    # hm "That soon? O-Okay. I'll be here if you need anything else."
    hm "这么快吗？哦——好、好的。你要是还有别的事，就来找我，我会一直在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Haimo_Normal_Talk_806687b6:

    # hm "Anytime, come back if you've got more questions."
    hm "随时都可以，有更多问题就再回来找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_75d1fa9b:

    # "You enter the courier office in goat tribe. It seems to be abandoned for a while, with a few letters and boxes scattered around the desk at the center of the room."
    "你走进了山羊部落的信使办公室。这里似乎已经废弃了一段时间，房间中央的桌子周围散落着几封信和几个箱子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_1d04b73c:

    # "Behind the desk it was an old goat, mostly black fur with some strips of white on his arms and a full white beard, scribbling something on a yellowed book. He raises his head, and addresses you."
    "桌子后面坐着一只年迈的山羊。他大部分的毛发都是黑色的，双臂上夹杂着几缕白毛，还留着一把全白的胡子，正伏在一本发黄的书上写着什么。他抬起头，向你搭话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_3fb309b3:

    # my "What can I help, [e]?"
    my "有什么我能帮你的，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_d46df5d7:

    # e "Oh! You know my name?"
    e "哦！你知道我的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_ff7c5172:

    # my "Yes, you are the courier goat that saved our Chief, right? We've heard your story."
    my "没错，你就是救过我们首领的那只信使山羊，对吧？我们都听说过你的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_f8ea7582:

    # my "That kid, Furkan, someone need to look after. the deer's too prideful to listen, so it's all depends on you, boy."
    my "那个孩子，弗坎，需要有人照看。那头鹿太过骄傲，不肯听劝，所以全靠你了，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_790d2537:

    # e "Uhm... yeah?"
    e "呃……对？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_604cee31:

    # my "Oh, what was I writing about..."
    my "哦，我刚才写到哪儿了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_c882ee17:

    # my "Yes, courier. You are still the courier from over the river, right?"
    my "是的，信使。你还是从河对岸来的那位信使，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_e9a3d85f:

    # e "I am, and you are?"
    e "是我，那你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_ed32a1be:

    # gof "You don't need to remember my name, I'm just an old goat handling letters and materials from Lusterfield."
    gof "你不用记住我的名字，我只是个负责处理卢斯特菲尔德来信和物资的老山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_34499fff:

    # e "O-okay, officer."
    e "好、好的，长官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_253116b1:

    # gof "The office shut down after the, you know, but now the kid asked me to come back, oh... well, at least I've got something to spend my time with."
    gof "办公室在那件事之后就关门了，不过现在那孩子又叫我回来。哦……这样也好，至少我有事可打发时间了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_e70fda77:

    # gof "If you have something for the other goats, just give it to me, [e]. I will hand them out later."
    gof "如果你有东西要交给其他山羊，就直接给我吧，[e]。我之后会替你分发给它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_dfcdee8a:

    # e "Got it!"
    e "明白了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_5bece3c5:

    # gof "Now, is there something you need?"
    gof "那么，你需要什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_2633c40a:

    # "You enter the courier office again, the officer lies back on his wooden chair, reading something that looks like a letter with squinted eyes."
    "你再次走进信使办公室，只见那位长官靠坐在木椅上，眯着眼睛阅读一封看起来像是信的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Courier_Office_5e4f5c51:

    # gof "Oh, you almost scared me there. What do you need, again?"
    gof "哦，你刚才差点吓到我了。你还需要什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Officer_Dialogue_76913d00:

    # e "That's enough for now, thanks, officer."
    e "暂时够了，谢谢你，长官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Officer_Dialogue_9d690da1:

    # gof "Alright, then."
    gof "好吧，那就这样。"
